to be more cartoonishly evil,

00:09:30.402 --> 00:09:32.905
but then Trump decided to make
himself the anti-mom president.

00:09:32.905 --> 00:09:34.707
What's next?
Is he gonna firebomb

00:09:34.707 --> 00:09:36.274
an apple pie at a baseball game?

00:09:36.274 --> 00:09:39.278
This is the clearest sign yet
that Trump has mom issues

00:09:39.278 --> 00:09:41.514
since every other sign.

00:09:41.514 --> 00:09:43.448
So, Trump announced a plan
to dispatch virtually

00:09:43.448 --> 00:09:46.552
every federal law enforcement
agency at his disposal

00:09:46.552 --> 00:09:48.287
to crack down
on peaceful protests

00:09:48.287 --> 00:09:51.023
and invade cities that don't
even want them, full-blast!

00:09:51.023 --> 00:09:54.259
Now, let's hear his plan
to address the raging pandemic

00:09:54.259 --> 00:09:56.262
he's neglected for six months

00:09:56.262 --> 00:09:59.465
at the cost of more
than 140,000 American lives.

00:09:59.465 --> 00:10:04.636
-We are in the process
of developing a strategy

00:10:04.636 --> 00:10:06.906
that's going to be very,
very powerful.

00:10:06.906 --> 00:10:09.474
We've developed them
as we go along.

00:10:09.474 --> 00:10:12.043
-You're developing
a strategy now?!

00:10:12.043 --> 00:10:13.979
What's the rush, my man?
It's only been six months.

00:10:13.979 --> 00:10:15.648
What have you been doin'
this whole time,

00:10:15.648 --> 00:10:17.717
studying up
for that cognitive test?

00:10:17.717 --> 00:10:19.184
[ As Trump ] Alright,
show me the flash cards.

00:10:19.184 --> 00:10:21.554
I got person, woman,

00:10:21.554 --> 00:10:23.588
man, camera, TV.

00:10:23.588 --> 00:10:25.724
Alright, I'm good to go.
Let's take the test.

00:10:25.724 --> 00:10:28.094
Sea Captain, by the way, do you
still remember all five things?

00:10:28.094 --> 00:10:29.995
-KFBR392.

00:10:29.995 --> 00:10:31.563
KFBR392.

00:10:31.563 --> 00:10:33.432
KFBR392.

00:10:33.432 --> 00:10:35.400
KFBR392.

00:10:35.400 --> 00:10:37.036
-You're welcome.
Six people?

00:10:37.036 --> 00:10:38.537
-Six?!

00:10:38.537 --> 00:10:40.906
-In fact, so far, the only plan
Trump seems to have is,

00:10:40.906 --> 00:10:42.641
once again, lying and claiming

00:10:42.641 --> 00:10:44.744
we're close to a cure
for coronavirus,

00:10:44.744 --> 00:10:46.879
as he has repeatedly for months.

00:10:46.879 --> 00:10:50.315
-We're doing tremendously well
on therapeutic research

00:10:50.315 --> 00:10:52.384
and tremendously well
on the vaccines.

00:10:52.384 --> 00:10:54.453
And, frankly, therapeutically,

00:10:54.453 --> 00:10:58.557
or maybe a word even
beyond that word is cure,

00:10:58.557 --> 00:11:01.059
would be the best of all,
and we'll see what happens.

00:11:01.059 --> 00:11:02.728
But that would be great,

00:11:02.728 --> 00:11:05.464
if we could go into the hospital
and just cure people,

00:11:05.464 --> 00:11:10.502
and we're at a position
we're actually able to,

00:11:10.502 --> 00:11:12.804
to a certain extent,
with what we have right now

00:11:12.804 --> 00:11:15.073
and we think, in a very
short period of time,

00:11:15.073 --> 00:11:16.308
we'll be able to do that.

00:11:16.308 --> 00:11:18.076
-Oh, yeah?
You come up with another one

00:11:18.076 --> 00:11:19.645
of your ingenious cures again?

00:11:19.645 --> 00:11:21.246
[ As Trump ] Okay, Fauci,
forget about the bleach.

00:11:21.246 --> 00:11:24.517
The bleach was a bad idea.
Pence's idea.

00:11:24.517 --> 00:11:26.318
I took the blame,
but Pence was --

00:11:26.318 --> 00:11:27.686
Pence was pushin' the bleach.

00:11:27.686 --> 00:11:29.588
Alright, how about this?
You fill a kiddie swimming pool

00:11:29.588 --> 00:11:32.558
