around in it naked

00:11:32.558 --> 00:11:35.460
and then,
when you're done, you

00:11:35.460 --> 00:11:37.730
shine a flashlight up your butt.
Would that work?

00:11:37.730 --> 00:11:38.764
Would that work, Fauci?

00:11:38.764 --> 00:11:40.299
Also, yeah, we all agree
it would be great

00:11:40.299 --> 00:11:42.767
if we could go into the hospital
and just cure people.

00:11:42.767 --> 00:11:44.503
Thank you for that
searing insight.

00:11:44.503 --> 00:11:46.805
Trump's like your super high
friend watchin' "Star Trek."

00:11:46.805 --> 00:11:50.242
[ subdued ]
Man, that would be great,
if we could just like

00:11:50.242 --> 00:11:53.779
