to another place.

00:11:53.779 --> 00:11:57.583
Yeah, Dave, that would be great,
but, in lieu of that,

00:11:57.583 --> 00:12:00.585
can I order you an Uber
so you can go home?

00:12:00.585 --> 00:12:03.054
Just step back and consider
the cruel contrast

00:12:03.054 --> 00:12:05.824
between Trump's plan
to send secret police to cities

00:12:05.824 --> 00:12:07.693
to crack down
on peaceful protests

00:12:07.693 --> 00:12:09.961
and his lack of a plan
for a raging pandemic

00:12:09.961 --> 00:12:12.130
that's killed 140,000 Americans

00:12:12.130 --> 00:12:14.366
and left tens of millions
out of work

00:12:14.366 --> 00:12:15.467
and many more suffering.

00:12:15.467 --> 00:12:16.769
There's a deeper problem here.

00:12:16.769 --> 00:12:20.305
Trump is just the most grotesque
and urgent manifestation

00:12:20.305 --> 00:12:21.406
of that problem in our history.

00:12:21.406 --> 00:12:23.342
Too often, our system uses

00:12:23.342 --> 00:12:26.712
