actual needs of human beings.

00:12:29.848 --> 00:12:31.583 line:0%
That's why our police
departments have tanks,

00:12:31.583 --> 00:12:34.019
but nearly 30 million people
don't have health insurance.

00:12:34.019 --> 00:12:36.221
It's why we have a Department
of Homeland Security,

00:12:36.221 --> 00:12:38.590
but 23 million Americans
face eviction.

00:12:38.590 --> 00:12:42.160
It's why the Pentagon gets
$740 billion a year,

00:12:42.160 --> 00:12:43.762 line:0%
